# GoGoCash 1.0 → 1.1 Migration Rules

## Source Repo

**GoGoCash 1.0:** https://github.com/mygogocash/gogocash_app

Before implementing any feature in 1.1, check if equivalent logic exists in 1.0.
Use 1.0 as the **functional specification** — it is what users currently experience.

## Feature Map

| 1.0 Location | 1.1 Location | Action |
|---|---|---|
| `src/features/auth/` | `src/features/mobile/login/` + `src/features/mobile/register/` | Reimplement with Tailwind |
| `src/features/home/` | `src/features/mobile/home/` | Reimplement with new design |
| `src/features/shop/` | `src/features/mobile/shop/` | Reimplement with new design |
| `src/features/category/` | Merge into shop filter `BottomSheet` | No separate page in 1.1 |
| `src/features/quest/` | `src/features/mobile/quest/` (NEW) | Reimplement — quests are NEW in 1.1 |
| `src/features/wallet/` | `src/app/[locale]/wallet/` | Reimplement, replace Ethers with Wagmi |
| `src/features/transaction/` | `src/app/[locale]/history/` | Reimplement with new design |
| `src/features/referral/` | `src/features/mobile/affiliate/` | Reimplement with tier system |
| `src/features/subscription/` | `src/app/[locale]/(page)/subscription/` | Port logic, restyle |
| `src/features/profile/` | `src/app/[locale]/profile/` | Reimplement with settings |
| `src/features/search/` | Merged into shop header search bar | No separate route in 1.1 |
| `src/components/analytics/` | `src/components/analytics/` | **COPY DIRECTLY — do not rewrite** |
| `src/components/common/OtpInput.tsx` | `src/components/common/OtpInput/` | **PORT LOGIC, restyle only** |
| `src/components/common/Button.tsx` | `src/components/common/Button/` | Rebuild with Tailwind variants |
| `src/components/common/Input.tsx` | `src/components/common/Input/` | Rebuild with Tailwind + zod |
| `src/i18n/` | `src/i18n/` | **COPY DIRECTLY** |
| `src/messages/en.json` | `src/messages/en.json` | Copy as base, extend for new features |
| `src/messages/th.json` | `src/messages/th.json` | Copy as base, extend for new features |
| `next-intl.config.ts` | `next-intl.config.ts` | **COPY DIRECTLY** |

## Dependency Migration

### Remove from 1.1 (already not present — keep it that way)
- `@mui/material` — replaced by Tailwind
- `@emotion/react` — replaced by Tailwind
- `@emotion/styled` — replaced by Tailwind
- `@mui/x-data-grid` — replaced by custom table components

### Add to 1.1 (present in 1.0, missing in 1.1 — install first)
```bash
yarn add next-intl firebase next-auth @crossmint/client-sdk-react-ui \
  swiper libphonenumber-js react-hot-toast react-error-boundary lodash
yarn add wagmi viem    # replaces ethers.js from 1.0
yarn add zod           # new in 1.1 for input validation
```

### Web3 Replacement (Ethers.js → Wagmi v2)

| 1.0 Ethers.js pattern | 1.1 Wagmi/Viem equivalent |
|---|---|
| `new ethers.BrowserProvider(window.ethereum)` | `useWalletClient()` |
| `new ethers.Contract(addr, abi, signer)` | `useWriteContract({ address, abi })` |
| `contract.withdraw(amount)` | `useWriteContract` → `writeContract({ functionName: 'withdraw', args: [amount] })` |
| `provider.getBalance(address)` | `useBalance({ address })` |
| `ethers.parseUnits('1.5', 6)` | `parseUnits('1.5', 6)` from `viem` |
| `ethers.formatUnits(amount, 6)` | `formatUnits(amount, 6)` from `viem` |
| `signer.getAddress()` | `useAccount()` → `address` |

## What Is NEW in 1.1 (Not in 1.0)

These features have no 1.0 equivalent — build from scratch using Figma:

1. **Quest system UI** — progress bars, streak counter, reward unlock animation
2. **Affiliate/tier center** — Bronze/Silver/Gold tiers, earnings table
3. **Saving Plus teaser** — locked UI with waitlist form (placeholder for 1.2)
4. **Cashback Lending placeholder** — design-visible, non-functional, "2026" badge
5. **Dark mode** — CSS variable-based theming
6. **Skeleton loaders** — on all data-fetching screens
7. **Multi-state components** — every component has loading + empty + error states

## Contracts (Multi-Chain Withdraw)

1.0 uses Ethers.js to call withdraw contracts on 4 chains.
1.1 replaces with Wagmi but the contract addresses and chain IDs stay the same.
Source chain config from env vars:
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID_WITHDRAW_POLYGON
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID_WITHDRAW_BNB
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID_WITHDRAW_SONIC
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN_ID_WITHDRAW_CELO
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTRACT_WITHDRAW_ADDRESS_POLYGON
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTRACT_WITHDRAW_ADDRESS_BNB
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTRACT_WITHDRAW_ADDRESS_SONIC
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTRACT_WITHDRAW_ADDRESS_CELO
```

## Do NOT Port

- Any MUI component (`<Box>`, `<Grid>`, `<DataGrid>`, `<TextField>`, etc.) — rebuild in Tailwind
- Any Emotion `styled()` usage — rebuild in Tailwind
- `CrossmintErrorBoundary.tsx` from 1.0 `components/common/` — use `react-error-boundary` directly in 1.1
